{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":156,"skin":"正月","skin_jp":"正月","skin_cn":"新年","skin_zh_tw":"正月","skin_list":[{"id":73,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":75,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/avatar.png","skin":"泳装","skin_cn":"泳装"},{"id":156,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/Student_Portrait_CH0197_Collection.png","skin":"正月","skin_cn":"新年"}],"family_name":"狮子堂","given_name":"泉","family_name_jp":"獅子堂","given_name_jp":"イズミ","family_name_kr":"시시도우","given_name_kr":"이즈미","family_name_en":"Shishido","given_name_en":"Izumi","family_name_zh_tw":"獅子堂","given_name_zh_tw":"泉","family_name_cn":"狮子堂","given_name_cn":"泉","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"美食与人生，都是一场冒险！","main_relation":29,"relation":[27],"age":16,"grade":"二年生","height":161,"birthday":"05-11","hobby":"制作古怪食物、吃古怪食物","designer":"Mx2J","illustrator":"Mx2J","character_voice":"久保百合花","character_voice_cn":"嘉儿","release_date":"2025-03-19","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":"2025-08-19","school":3,"weapon_type":"MG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":false,"spine":[206,923],"model":[37,297],"voice":[{"description":"CH0197_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝~档案！","text_original":"ブル～アーカイブ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/CH0197_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"今年会邂逅什么样的味道呢～？","text_original":"今年はどんな味に出会えるんだろう～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"美～食的～冒～险～真期待呀！","text_original":"び～しょくの～ぼ～けん楽しみだなぁ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"在这里的话……好像有点想吃那个！","text_original":"ここだと……アレ食べたいかも！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"首先得把我特制的秘传酱汁拿过来才行！","text_original":"まずは私特製・秘伝ソースを持ってこなきゃ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"要不要尝尝鲱鱼薄荷章鱼烧？","text_original":"イワシミントたこ焼き、食べない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"要尝尝味道吗？","text_original":"味見していく？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"光是看着老师你吃得那~么香，我的心情就会变得超级幸福呢！","text_original":"美味しそう～に食べる先生を見ているだけで、すっごく幸せな気持ちになるんだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"和老师在一起，总是有好多新的发现！就像邂逅新的味道时一样，让我感到好心动！","text_original":"先生と一緒にいると、発見がいっぱい！新しい味に出会ったときみたいに、ドキドキする！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"听说冒险是要和伙伴一起去的！当我们去进行美食冒险的时候，老师也一起去吧～！","text_original":"冒険は仲間と行くものなんだって！美食の冒険に出る時は、先生も一緒に行こ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_eventlobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"我也是美食研究会的一员嘛！寻找新味道的冒险是不会停止的！","text_original":"私も美食研究会の一員だもん！新しい味を探す冒険はやめないよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_eventlobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_eventlobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"那就是我的美食之道！","text_original":"それが私の、美食道！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_eventlobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"来吧，老师！新年到啦～！我们开始寻找美食的冒险吧！","text_original":"さあ先生！新年だよ～！美食を求める冒険をはじめよっか！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"你有什么想吃的东西吗？我的话，那个也想吃，这个也想吃，所～有东西都想吃！","text_original":"食べたいものとかある？私はね、あれもこれも、ぜーんぶ食べたい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"唔，嚼嚼嚼……嗯嗯……？给，请吧！","text_original":"はむ、もぐもぐ……んん……？はいどーぞ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"啊呜……啊……要吃这个吗？","text_original":"あむ……あ……これ食べる？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"啊呜啊呜……啊，抱歉！我把这个给你吧！","text_original":"はむはむ……あ、ごめん！こっちあげるね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"锵锵！请享用美味吧～！","text_original":"じゃじゃーん！美味しく召し上がれ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"你不饿吗？来，吃吧！","text_original":"お腹空いてない？はい、食べて！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"呀吼～！这个给你！","text_original":"やっほ～！これどうぞ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"寻求美食的冒险有时会伴随着危险……所以，就由我来保护老师吧！","text_original":"美食の冒険はときに危険が伴うもの……だから、私が先生を守ってあげるね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"新年快乐—！老师！今年也朝着美食的冒险，出发吧—！","text_original":"あけましておめでとうー！先生！今年も美食の冒険へ、いざゆかーん！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"咦！？有这么多？可以吗？欸嘿嘿，那我就开动啦～！","text_original":"えっ！？こんなに？いいの？えへへ、いっただきま～す！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"每一样都很好吃！谢谢你，老师！","text_original":"どれも美味しい！ありがと、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"真的可以收下这么多吗！？下次我带你去我推荐的店哦！","text_original":"こんなにもらっちゃっていいの！？今度、オススメのお店に連れてったげるね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"好不可思议的味道啊～！啊，这个是食物对吧？","text_original":"不思議な味～！あ、これ食べ物だよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师！工作结束之后，我们去吃好吃的吧！","text_original":"先生！お仕事終わったら、美味しいの食べに行こう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"欸？不知道什么时候能结束吗……？","text_original":"えっ？いつ終わるか、分からないの……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"怎么这样……好寂寞哦……","text_original":"そんなぁ……寂しいよお……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"我自从遇到老师以后，变化可大了呢！","text_original":"私、先生にあってからだいぶ変わったんだよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯……具体来说嘛～","text_original":"えっとね……具体的には～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"……","text_original":"……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_2_4","category":"lobby","text":"总之，就是变了嘛！","text_original":"とにかく、変わったんだよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_2_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗓子不舒服的话要告诉我哦。","text_original":"喉の調子が悪かったら言ってね","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"锵——！咸味的甘草糖！","text_original":"じゃーん！塩味のリコリスキャンディ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"听说这个对嗓子很好哦！味道也非常有趣呢！","text_original":"これ、喉にいいんだって！味もすっごく面白いんだよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"喂喂，老师！对你来说，什么样的时光算是特别的呢？","text_original":"ねえねえ先生！どんな時間が特別だったりする？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"对我来说呢，以前是寻找美食、邂逅新味道……来着。","text_original":"私はね、美味しいものを探したり、新しい味と出会うこと…………だったんだけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"不过现在呀，是和老师你在一起的时间最特别了。","text_original":"今はね、先生との時間が一番、特別なんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_4_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"美食能带给我意想不到的心动感觉！所以呀，我想要尝试更多形形色色的新事物～！","text_original":"美味しいものは私に、想像もしなかったドキドキをくれるんだ！だからね、もっと色んな新しいことに挑戦してみたいんだ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"那个，老师你怎么看？","text_original":"ね、先生はどう思う？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊！你回来啦！我一直在等你哦，老师！","text_original":"あっ！おかえりー！待ってたよ、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_login_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，今天也辛苦了！来，这是欢迎回来的抱抱～！","text_original":"先生、今日もお疲れ様！はい、おかえりなさいのぎゅ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_login_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"咦？心意领了就好？是吗？","text_original":"……え？気持ちだけでいい？そう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_login_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"既然老师都这么说了……","text_original":"先生がそう言うなら……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_login_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，跟你说哦。","text_original":"あのね、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"新年的美食除了御节料理之外，还有很多别的呢！","text_original":"お正月の料理って、おせちの他にもいろいろあるんだって！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"所以，我准备了超——级多哦！","text_original":"だから、い～っぱい用意してみたの！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_1_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"我吗？我的话……","text_original":"私？私は……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"光是看着老师你吃，就已经很幸福了哦。","text_original":"先生が食べてるとこ、見てるだけで幸せだよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"还有嘛……能像这样和老师","text_original":"あとは……先生とこうして","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"两个人在一起就满足了……吧！","text_original":"二人でいられたらそれで満足！かな！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊！那个……","text_original":"あっ！えっと……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"我不小心说了点……让人害羞的话呢……","text_original":"ちょっと、恥ずかしいこと言っちゃった……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"可、可是！我很幸福哦！","text_original":"で、でも！幸せだから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"所以没关系！不要紧的！","text_original":"問題ない！大丈夫！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"参拜的时候许了什么愿呀～？我呀，许了“希望可以和老师更多地待在一起～”的愿望哦！","text_original":"お参りでなにお願いした～？私はね、先生ともっと一緒にいれますように～ってお願いしたよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"和老师在一起的时候，我超级心动的！比制作我特制的秘传酱汁的时候还要心动！","text_original":"先生と一緒にいるとすっごくドキドキするんだ！私特製・秘伝ソースを作ったとき以上に、すっごく！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师，可以牵着手吗—？欸嘿嘿！难得有机会，我们来挽着胳膊吧！","text_original":"先生、手、つないでもいいー？えへへっ！せっかくだから、腕組んじゃお！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"看着老师的脸，总觉得心里暖洋洋的……比吃到美食、发现新味道的时候还要暖和。感觉超～级幸福！","text_original":"先生の顔を見てると、なんだかぽかぽかするんだ……美味しいものを食べたときよりも、新しい味を見つけたときよりも。すっごく幸せ～って感じ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊！我的生日！你还记得吗？好开心！欸嘿嘿，我们一起吃蛋糕吧～！","text_original":"あ！私の誕生日！覚えてくれてたの？嬉しい！えへへっ、ケーキ、一緒に食べよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"诶？被庆祝的人自己准备蛋糕……很奇怪吗？","text_original":"え？祝ってもらう側がケーキを用意するのって、ヘン？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_birthday_3","category":"lobby","text":"才没那回事呢！吃蛋糕才是最重要的呀！没有其他比这更重要的事情啦！","text_original":"そんなことないよ！ケーキを食べるっていうのが大事なの！他に大切なことなんてないよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_birthday_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，我记得哦！今天是老师你的生日对吧？为了不忘记，我还特地记下来了呢！欸嘿嘿。","text_original":"あ、覚えてるよ！今日は先生の誕生日でしょ？忘れないよう、ちゃんと書いておいたの！えへへっ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"锵锵～！我买了蛋糕来哦！……我特制的粉末？还没撒上去呢？","text_original":"じゃじゃ～ん！ケーキ買ってきたんだ！……私特製・パウダー？まだかけてないよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"糖果和南瓜派～看起来好好吃！","text_original":"キャンディとかぼちゃのパイ～美味しそう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果淋上我特制的糖霜，味道会变得更~有趣！","text_original":"私特製・アイシングをかけたら、もっ～と面白い味になると思う！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"……啊，不小心淋太多了……","text_original":"……あっ、かけすぎちゃった……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_halloween_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"欸嘿嘿！因为是正月，所以我试着穿了和服！怎么样？","text_original":"えへへっ！お正月だから着物を着てみたの！どうかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"不过，吃饭的时候有点麻烦呢。必须得小心袖子才行……","text_original":"でも、ごはん食べるのちょっと大変なんだ。袖を気をつけなきゃいけなくて……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"火鸡和鸡肉！百果馅饼和蛋奶酒！如果再加上我特制的秘传酱汁……圣诞节的准备就万无一失啦！","text_original":"七面鳥とチキン！ミンスパイにエッグノッグ！そこに私特製・秘伝ソースがあれば……クリスマスの準備はバッチリ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，当然也有老师你的份哦～！","text_original":"あ、ちゃんと先生の分もあるよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"哇！老师，这边这边！","text_original":"わっ！先生、こっちこっち！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"好的！我也出发了！","text_original":"はーい！私も行くよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"叫我吗~？","text_original":"呼んだ～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/jp/ch0197_formation_in_1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/kr/ch0197_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/kr/ch0197_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/kr/ch0197_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90%E5%A0%82%20%E6%B3%89/%E6%AD%A3%E6%9C%88/kr/ch0197_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0197_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8B%AE%E5%AD%90